# GazaOS Manifest

GazaOS is a custom ROM based on AOSP and Lunaris-AOSP, integrating customizations from crDroid, LineageOS, and other leading Android open-source distributions.

## Initialize local repository

```bash
repo init -u https://github.com/GazaOS/android -b 16.2 --git-lfs
```

## Sync

```bash
repo sync -c -j$(nproc --all) --force-sync --no-clone-bundle --no-tags
```

## Build

Set up the build environment:
```bash
. build/envsetup.sh
```

Lunch a target:
```bash
lunch lineage_<device_codename>-bp4a-user
```

Start compiling:
```bash
m bacon
```
